Cell[TextData[StyleBox["The elastic energy is calculated by integrating the \
elastic energy density over the volume of the upper helicoidal shell.\n\
Incorporating the volume contribution of the upper helicoidal shell to the \
elastic energy density and assuming that the characteristic values of the \
work, the potential energy, and the elastic energy are equal implies that", \
"Output"]], "Text",
