Cell[TextData[StyleBox["In order to find the normalized axial force, F, and \
normalized torque, T, respectively, I define their equilibrium equations \
along the z-axis and the opposite direction of the z-axis, respectively. This \
may be expressed as", "Output"]], "Text",
